<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (Filmed a presenter Ad, where I promoted the general assembly program part of a university project. The project aimed to talk about the benefits of the program, encouraging university students and fresh graduates to take part of it. The script and storyboard was written by me, and the green screen and cameras were provided by the instructors. Adobe Premiere Pro was used for the editing and subtitles, Adobe Audition was used for Audio Cleaning and enhancement, and Adobe After Effects was used for the motion graphics. The motion graphics were downloaded as PNG images from Canva and Vecteezy. Find the videos here.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8 534 0 R 10]
>>
